<title>FINLAND: Finnish September GDP rises 4.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish September GDP rises 4.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 4.1 percent year-on-year in September Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.4 percent in September on August, SF said.</p>
<p>			 Sept 1996	Aug 1996	Sept 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +4.1 pct	 +2.1 pct	+2.8 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.4 pct	 +0.3 pct	+4.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
